    "tpc_seq": 1,
    "tpc_book": "<ol>\n\t<li>Shin Aiba著，林書嫻譯 (2020) 折疊都市：從日本的都市規劃實踐經驗，探尋人口減少時代的城市設計和人本生活，臉譜出版社</li>\n\t<li>唐燕 (2020) 城市規劃設計在韓國，清華大學出版社（簡體）</li>\n\t<li>蔡燕寳譯 (2007) 圖解都市計畫，詹氏書局</li>\n\t<li>時報文教基金會 (2004) 前瞻與決斷：國土規劃「政策環評與民眾參與」，余紀忠文教基金會</li>\n\t<li>張偉斌(2000)，都市計畫學</li>\n\t<li>施鴻志（1997），都市規劃，建都文化事業股份有限公司。</li>\n\t<li>John William Reps (2021) The Making of Urban America: A History of City Planning in the United States, Princeton University Press</li>\n\t<li>Nadin et al. (2015) Town and Country Planning in the UK, 15th Edition, Routledge</li>\n\t<li>\n\t<div>&bull;Am&eacute;lie&nbsp; Balencourt and Antonio Curado Zafra (2012) City Marketing: How&nbsp;to&nbsp;promote a city? The case of Ume&aring;, Master Thesis, Ume&aring; School of Business, Ume&aring; Universitet</div>\n\t</li>\n\t<li>Burton, Elizabeth, Mike Jenks, and Katie Williams, eds. (2003) The compact city: a sustainable urban form?. Routledge</li>\n\t<li>Hoch Charles J., Dalton Linda C., So Frank (2000), The Practice of Local Government Planning, ICMA</li>\n\t<li>Levy, John, M. (1997), Contemporary Urban Planning, Prentice Hall.</li>\n\t<li>Campbell, Fainstein (1996) Planning Theory&cedil;Oxford, UK: Blackwell Publishers.</li>\n\t<li>Campbell, Scott (1996)&nbsp;&quot;Green cities, growing cities, just cities?: Urban planning and the contradictions of sustainable development.&quot; Journal of the American Planning Association 62(3) pp.296-312</li>\n\t<li>Kaiser, Edward J., David R. Godschalk, and F. Stuart Chapin (1995)&nbsp;Urban land use planning. Vol. 4. Urbana, IL: University of Illinois Press</li>\n</ol>\n",
